"Keep the default address filled in here to get administrative address "
"changes (province/ward renames, boundary updates) as soon as they're "
"published, without needing to update the plugin itself. Checkout still works "
"even if this is left blank or the server is temporarily unreachable - the "
"plugin automatically falls back to the data bundled with the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Wir empfehlen, den Standard-API-Server des Plugins beizubehalten, um die "
"neuesten Änderungen der vietnamesischen Verwaltungsadressen zu erhalten."

